  "notes": "{賭|か}ける means to bet or wager on something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜に{賭|か}ける: to bet on (something)\n- 〜を{賭|か}ける: to stake (something)\n- {命|いのち}を{賭|か}ける: to risk one's life\n- {名誉|めいよ}を{賭|か}ける: to stake one's honor\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {賭|か}け: bet, wager (noun)\n- {賭博|とばく}: gambling\n- {賭|か}け{事|ごと}: gambling\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を〜に{賭|か}ける\n\nUSAGE:\nThis is a different word from かける (00854_kakeru) which means \"to hang\" or \"to make a call.\"",
